WEBVTT

00:35:29.570 --> 00:35:33.571
JD: Yeah, we have to
prime ourselves, partly,

00:35:33.595 --> 00:35:37.173
about the positive potential
in the other person.

00:35:37.197 --> 00:35:39.676
(Music)

00:35:39.700 --> 00:35:41.908
AG: You can't force
a high-quality interaction

00:35:41.932 --> 00:35:43.866
with anyone and everyone you encounter.

00:35:43.890 --> 00:35:46.896
Some people will just
be in their heads, closed off.

00:35:46.920 --> 00:35:50.236
But if your team or organization
isn't doing anything about loneliness

00:35:50.260 --> 00:35:51.417
on a larger scale,

00:35:51.441 --> 00:35:54.598
you might be able to brighten
your own day and other people's days

00:35:54.622 --> 00:35:57.286
by simply engaging with them
in small ways,

00:35:57.310 --> 00:35:58.592
ways that acknowledge them

00:35:58.616 --> 00:36:00.777
and make you feel connected, too.